%% v1.3.3 时序图 · 完整版
%% 包含：团队协作 / Onboard→Refine→进化闭环 / 入口路由

%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 时序图 1：团队协作（意图广播 → 触发反应 → 冲突消解 → 反馈放大）
%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent A (leader, trust=0.9)
    participant B as Agent B (member, trust=0.7)
    participant TM as TeamManager
    participant IB as IntentBus
    participant TS as TeamStateCRDT
    participant CR as ConflictResolver
    participant FA as FeedbackAmplifier
    participant AL as AuditLog (decision-log)
    participant TK as think.md

    Note over A,B: ① 建队 + 成员加入
    A->>TM: createTeam(team-finance-001)
    TM->>TS: initTeamState({ teamId, name })
    TM->>TM: saveState() → data/teams/<id>/team-state.automerge
    A->>TM: joinTeam(teamId, agent-a, leader, 0.9)
    B->>TM: joinTeam(teamId, agent-b, member, 0.7)
    TM->>TS: updateMember(doc, memberState)

    Note over A,B: ② 意图广播 → 触发反应
    A->>TM: broadcastIntent(intent.create.report, reports/q4.md)
    TM->>IB: broadcast(IntentEvent)
    IB->>IB: matchIntent("intent.create.*", event.intent)
    IB->>B: notifySubscribers(event)
    Note right of B: B 订阅了 intent.create.* → 触发
    B->>TM: dispatchTask(task-001, agent-b)

    Note over A,B: ③ 文件锁冲突 → 冲突消解
    A->>TM: acquireFileLock(reports/q4.md)
    B->>TM: acquireFileLock(reports/q4.md)
    TM->>CR: resolveConflict([A(0.9, ts1), B(0.7, ts2)])
    Note right of CR: ① trust 降序：A(0.9) > B(0.7) → A 胜
    CR-->>TM: winner = Agent A
    TM->>AL: emitDecision(kind=TEAM, moment=ACT,<br/>why="文件锁冲突消解：A(trust=0.9) 胜出 B(trust=0.7)")
    TM-->>B: lock denied（等待 A 完成）
    TM-->>A: lock acquired

    Note over A,B: ④ A 完成任务 → B 重试
    A->>TM: collectResult(task-001) → releaseLock
    TM->>TS: updateTask(doc, { status: done })
    B->>TM: acquireFileLock(reports/q4.md) → acquired

    Note over A,B: ⑤ 反馈放大（团队级学习）
    B->>TM: 报告人工纠正："工具描述必须带 example"
    TM->>FA: amplify(correction)
    FA->>FA: isTeamReusable? → yes (quality_rule)
    FA->>IB: broadcast(intent.share.quality_rule)
    FA->>TS: addFeedback(doc, { type: quality_rule, content })
    FA->>TK: appendToMemberThink(agent-a, entry) via atomicAppendSync
    FA->>TK: appendToMemberThink(agent-b, entry) via atomicAppendSync
    Note right of FA: 团队成员都学到了<br/>Refine quality-rule-set 也会加载


%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 时序图 2：Onboard → Refine 自动触发 → 进化闭环
%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OD as OnboardDriver (loop-agent)
    participant RD as RefineDriver
    participant QJ as QualityJudge
    participant QRS as QualityRuleSet
    participant OL as OptimizationLoop
    participant CG as ContaminationGuard
    participant SM as SnapshotManager
    participant BM as Benchmark (case-evaluator)
    participant EL as EvaluationLog
    participant AL as AuditLog (decision-log)

    Note over OD: Onboard L1-L5 循环（v1.3.2 已有）
    OD->>OD: L1 run → judge (crash/error/timeout/passed)
    OD->>OD: L2 ontology-comparator → DiffReport
    OD->>OD: L3 error-localizer → L4 fix-applier → L5 收敛判定

    Note over OD: L5 收敛出口（driver.ts:383）
    OD->>OD: consecutivePassCount >= convergeThreshold
    OD->>OD: convergenceState = 'converged'
    OD->>RD: onConverged({ taskId, agentId })

    Note over RD: Refine 循环启动（复用 loop-agent L1/L3/L4/L5）
    RD->>QRS: all()（三来源合并）
    QRS->>QRS: loadBuiltin()（内置模板）
    QRS->>QRS: loadCustomer(delivery-report.md)
    QRS->>QRS: loadTeam(team-state.feedback[])
    QRS-->>RD: QualityRule[]

    RD->>RD: L1 run → judge (复用 judge.ts)
    RD->>QJ: judge(output, ruleSet, taskId)
    Note right of QJ: 替代 ontology-comparator<br/>接口对齐 DiffReport
    QJ->>QJ: checkRule(output, rule) → DiffMismatch[]
    QJ-->>RD: DiffReport (质量差异)

    alt 有质量差异
        RD->>RD: L3 localizeError (复用 error-localizer.ts)
        RD->>RD: L4 applyFix (复用 fix-applier.ts)
        Note right of RD: 只改经验层<br/>审计引擎卡关
    end

    Note over RD: Refine 收敛 → 触发进化闭环
    RD->>OL: run(benchmarkId, agentId)

    Note over OL: evidence → hypothesis → Candidate → eval → accept/rollback
    OL->>CG: check(optimizer context)
    CG->>CG: scanForRubric / scanForGold
    alt 检测到污染
        CG->>CG: recover() + 停止
        OL-->>RD: aborted (contamination detected)
    end

    OL->>SM: createSnapshot()
    SM-->>OL: snapshotId = v3

    OL->>OL: formHypothesis(evidence)
    Note right of OL: Candidate 只修改<br/>think.md + knowledge/
    OL->>OL: applyCandidate(hypothesis) via atomicWriteSync

    OL->>BM: evaluateCase() 重跑评分
    BM-->>OL: score = 78

    OL->>EL: appendEvaluationRecord(input) HMAC 链落盘

    alt score (78) > Reference (75) → strictly improves
        OL->>SM: bumpVersion() → v4
        OL->>AL: emitDecision(kind=EVOLUTION,<br/>evidence=["case-003: 78>75", "hypothesis: 补充 few-shot"])
        Note right of OL: accept（版本号只增不减）
    else score ≤ Reference
        OL->>SM: rollback(snapshotId=v3)
        OL->>AL: emitDecision(kind=EVOLUTION,<br/>evidence=["rollback: 73<75"])
        Note right of OL: rollback（版本号不重用）
    end


%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 时序图 3：入口路由（用户 Agent 请求 → workflow 匹配）
%% ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UA as User Agent (WorkBuddy/Codex)
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant RR as RouteRequest
    participant WP as WorkflowParser
    participant AL as AuditLog

    UA->>MCP: route_workflow({ request: "生成季度财报" })

    MCP->>WP: parseWorkflowYaml(workflowYaml)
    Note over WP: WorkflowNode 现解析 type + hitl 字段<br/>type: 🔄/⚡/👤 → machine / auto / human
    WP-->>MCP: ParsedWorkflow (nodes with type)

    MCP->>RR: route("生成季度财报", workflow)

    loop 遍历节点
        RR->>RR: matchNode(request, node)
        RR->>RR: semanticSimilarity(request, node.task) → 0.85
        RR->>RR: checkType(node) → type=⚡ → 可路由
    end

    alt 命中 ⚡/🔄 节点（相似度 > 阈值）
        RR-->>MCP: { route: 'workflow', node: 'financial-report', confidence: 0.85 }
        MCP->>AL: emitDecision(kind=ORCHESTRATION,<br/>why="路由命中 financial-report (⚡)")
        MCP-->>UA: { route: 'workflow', node: 'financial-report' }
        Note right of UA: 用户 Agent 调用 sofagent workflow 节点
    else 不命中（相似度 < 阈值 或 type=👤）
        RR-->>MCP: { route: 'fallback', reason: "无匹配节点" }
        MCP->>AL: emitDecision(kind=ORCHESTRATION,<br/>why="路由 fallback：无匹配节点")
        MCP-->>UA: { route: 'fallback', reason }
        Note right of UA: fallback → 用户 Agent 用自己的 LLM 处理<br/>sofagent 不强制
    end
